{"id": "draft-c10-01", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "级数", "concept": "交错级数与绝对收敛", "concept_id": "C10", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-015"], "problem": "定义$u_{2k-1}=1/k$、$u_{2k}=-1/k+2^{-k}$（$k\\ge1$）。求$\\sum_{n\\ge1}u_n$的和与敛散类型，并判断绝对值单调递减是否为交错级数收敛的必要条件。", "solution": "由$2^k>k$知偶项为负，奇项为正。精确部分和为$S_{2N}=1-2^{-N}$、$S_{2N+1}=1-2^{-N}+1/(N+1)$，均趋于$1$。而$\\sum_{n=1}^{2N}|u_n|=2\\sum_{k=1}^N1/k-1+2^{-N}\\to\\infty$，所以条件收敛。$|u_4|=1/4<|u_5|=1/3$，绝对值不单调；莱布尼茨的单调条件是充分条件，并非必要条件。", "answer": "条件收敛，和$1$；绝对值不单调，单调性不是必要条件。", "method": "成对抵消与必要条件反例", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "结构改写：成对抵消与必要条件反例", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["定义$u_{2k-1}=1/k$、$u_{2k}=-1/k+2^{-k}$（$k\\ge1$）。求$\\sum_{n\\ge1}u_n$的和与敛散类型，并判断绝对值单调递减是否为交错级数收敛的必要条件。", "条件收敛，和$1$；绝对值不单调，单调性不是必要条件。"], "steps": ["第一步:由$2^k>k$知偶项为负，奇项为正。", "第二步:精确部分和为$S_{2N}=1-2^{-N}$、$S_{2N+1}=1-2^{-N}+1/(N+1)$，均趋于$1$。", "第三步:而$\\sum_{n=1}^{2N}|u_n|=2\\sum_{k=1}^N1/k-1+2^{-N}\\to\\infty$，所以条件收敛。", "第四步:$|u_4|=1/4<|u_5|=1/3$，绝对值不单调；莱布尼茨的单调条件是充分条件，并非必要条件。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c10-01", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "507639bd455a17fb7d8c9846b23ec978eb2312436b4b2c92e5a28e71ce8671a4", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c10-01", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-015"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "替换与留出集相同的交错调和求和；改为成对抵消、非单调振幅及精确奇偶部分和。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c10-01"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c10-02", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "级数", "concept": "交错级数与绝对收敛", "concept_id": "C10", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-015"], "problem": "设$b_n=1/\\sqrt{n(n+1)}$，$a_n=b_n+(-1)^n/[n(n+1)]$。证明$a_n>0$、$a_n$不单调，且$\\sum_{n\\ge1}(-1)^na_n$条件收敛。说明绝对可和扰动为何不破坏交错级数的收敛。", "solution": "$b_n>1/[n(n+1)]$，故$a_n>0$。$b_n$递减趋零，$\\sum(-1)^nb_n$由莱布尼茨判别法收敛。扰动项满足$\\sum1/[n(n+1)]\\le\\sum1/n^2<\\infty$，故$\\sum(-1)^na_n=\\sum(-1)^nb_n+\\sum1/[n(n+1)]$收敛。对绝对值，$a_n\\ge1/(n+1)-1/[n(n+1)]$；前一正项级数发散、后一收敛，因此绝对值级数发散。又$a_4-a_3=\\sqrt5/10-\\sqrt3/6+2/15>2/10-2/6+2/15=0$，故不单调。一般地，若$\\sum(-1)^nb_n$收敛、$\\sum|c_n|<\\infty$，则$\\sum(-1)^n(b_n+c_n)$是两个收敛级数之和。这里的收敛由判别法和绝对可和扰动证明，不用数值试算。", "answer": "正振幅不单调，但交错级数条件收敛；绝对可和扰动保持收敛。", "method": "扰动定理与条件收敛", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "结构改写：扰动定理与条件收敛", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["设$b_n=1/\\sqrt{n(n+1)}$，$a_n=b_n+(-1)^n/[n(n+1)]$。证明$a_n>0$、$a_n$不单调，且$\\sum_{n\\ge1}(-1)^na_n$条件收敛。说明绝对可和扰动为何不破坏交错级数的收敛。", "正振幅不单调，但交错级数条件收敛；绝对可和扰动保持收敛。"], "steps": ["第一步:$b_n>1/[n(n+1)]$，故$a_n>0$。", "第二步:$b_n$递减趋零，$\\sum(-1)^nb_n$由莱布尼茨判别法收敛。", "第三步:扰动项满足$\\sum1/[n(n+1)]\\le\\sum1/n^2<\\infty$，故$\\sum(-1)^na_n=\\sum(-1)^nb_n+\\sum1/[n(n+1)]$收敛。", "第四步:对绝对值，$a_n\\ge1/(n+1)-1/[n(n+1)]$；前一正项级数发散、后一收敛，因此绝对值级数发散。", "第五步:又$a_4-a_3=\\sqrt5/10-\\sqrt3/6+2/15>2/10-2/6+2/15=0$，故不单调。", "第六步:一般地，若$\\sum(-1)^nb_n$收敛、$\\sum|c_n|<\\infty$，则$\\sum(-1)^n(b_n+c_n)$是两个收敛级数之和。", "第七步:这里的收敛由判别法和绝对可和扰动证明，不用数值试算。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c10-02", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "af5d432caae609113046d9415ca99a036317cea82eac4e29a7c860dfa5e74c21", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c10-02", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-015"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "增加非单调绝对可和扰动，改变仅换数值的莱布尼茨例题结构。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c10-02"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c10-03", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "级数", "concept": "交错级数与绝对收敛", "concept_id": "C10", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-015"], "problem": "说明级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^n(2+(-1)^n)}{n}$ 发散，并解释莱布尼茨判别法为何不能使用。", "solution": "第$2k-1$项为$-1/(2k-1)$，第$2k$项为$3/(2k)$，成对和为$(4k-3)/[2k(2k-1)]\\ge1/(2k)$。所以$S_{2N}\\ge\\frac12\\sum_{k=1}^N1/k\\to+\\infty$；$S_{2N+1}=S_{2N}-1/(2N+1)\\to+\\infty$。振幅也不递减：$1/(2k-1)<3/(2k)$。因此不能用莱布尼茨判别法，级数发散到$+\\infty$。", "answer": "级数发散(拆成 $2\\sum(-1)^n/n+\\sum1/n$,收敛+发散);莱布尼茨判别法因通项绝对值不单调而不可用。", "method": "拆项分析(单调性条件的必要性)", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "单调性不满足:莱布尼茨条件失效的反例辨析", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["说明级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^n(2+(-1)^n)}{n}$ 发散，并解释莱布尼茨判别法为何不能使用。", "级数发散(拆成 $2\\sum(-1)^n/n+\\sum1/n$,收敛+发散);莱布尼茨判别法因通项绝对值不单调而不可用。"], "steps": ["第一步:第$2k-1$项为$-1/(2k-1)$，第$2k$项为$3/(2k)$，成对和为$(4k-3)/[2k(2k-1)]\\ge1/(2k)$。", "第二步:所以$S_{2N}\\ge\\frac12\\sum_{k=1}^N1/k\\to+\\infty$；$S_{2N+1}=S_{2N}-1/(2N+1)\\to+\\infty$。", "第三步:振幅也不递减：$1/(2k-1)<3/(2k)$。", "第四步:因此不能用莱布尼茨判别法，级数发散到$+\\infty$。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c10-03", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "272e990af3d0ccf22774d5dda4ff6295afc36f738b40d94c29d53d7d69ad4ccf", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c10-03", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-015"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "改用有限成对部分和下界，避免把发散无穷和当成数相加。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c10-03"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c10-04", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "级数", "concept": "交错级数与绝对收敛", "concept_id": "C10", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-015"], "problem": "对$S=\\sum_{n\\ge1}(-1)^{n-1}/3^n$，求精确余项$R_N=S-S_N$；求使实际误差严格小于$1/2500$的最小$N$，再求只使用莱布尼茨界即可保证该条件的最小$N$。", "solution": "几何级数给$S=1/4$、$S_N=(1-(-1/3)^N)/4$，故$R_N=(-1)^N/(4\\cdot3^N)$。实际误差条件等价于$3^N>625$；$3^5=243<625<729=3^6$，最小$N=6$。莱布尼茨界为$|R_N|\\le3^{-(N+1)}$，仅依此保证严格小于$1/2500$需$3^{N+1}>2500$；$3^7=2187<2500<6561=3^8$，最小$N=7$。$S_6=182/729$、$R_6=1/2916$，均为精确分数。界给出的充分条件不能冒充实际最小项数。", "answer": "$R_N=(-1)^N/(4\\cdot3^N)$；实际最小$N=6$，仅用莱布尼茨界的最小$N=7$。", "method": "精确误差与判别法界的区别", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "结构改写：精确误差与判别法界的区别", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["对$S=\\sum_{n\\ge1}(-1)^{n-1}/3^n$，求精确余项$R_N=S-S_N$；求使实际误差严格小于$1/2500$的最小$N$，再求只使用莱布尼茨界即可保证该条件的最小$N$。", "$R_N=(-1)^N/(4\\cdot3^N)$；实际最小$N=6$，仅用莱布尼茨界的最小$N=7$。"], "steps": ["第一步:几何级数给$S=1/4$、$S_N=(1-(-1/3)^N)/4$，故$R_N=(-1)^N/(4\\cdot3^N)$。", "第二步:实际误差条件等价于$3^N>625$；$3^5=243<625<729=3^6$，最小$N=6$。", "第三步:莱布尼茨界为$|R_N|\\le3^{-(N+1)}$，仅依此保证严格小于$1/2500$需$3^{N+1}>2500$；$3^7=2187<2500<6561=3^8$，最小$N=7$。", "第四步:$S_6=182/729$、$R_6=1/2916$，均为精确分数。", "第五步:界给出的充分条件不能冒充实际最小项数。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c10-04", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "8a9670bd314504f0252327f115be9c7144aa6e742d97d2a5a591fca3a2d168d1", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c10-04", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-015"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "删除小数估算，改为精确余项与充分界的严格最小项数比较。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c10-04"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c10-05", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "级数", "concept": "交错级数与绝对收敛", "concept_id": "C10", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-015"], "problem": "证明莱布尼茨判别法:若 $a_n$ 单调递减趋于 $0$,则交错级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n+1}a_n$ 收敛,且其和 $S$ 满足 $|S-S_N|\\le a_{N+1}$。", "solution": "设$a_n\\ge0$、$a_{n+1}\\le a_n$且$a_n\\to0$，$S_N=\\sum_{n=1}^N(-1)^{n-1}a_n$。偶部分和递增，奇部分和递减，且$S_{2m}\\le S_{2l+1}$对一切$m,l$成立；两序列有界并有极限，差$S_{2N+1}-S_{2N}=a_{2N+1}\\to0$，故极限相同，记为$S$。由夹逼，对任意$N$有$0\\le(-1)^N(S-S_N)\\le a_{N+1}$，所以$|S-S_N|\\le a_{N+1}$。该证明只涉及有限部分和及其极限。", "answer": "证明见解法(偶子列单调有界、奇子列同极限;余项 $|S-S_N|\\le a_{N+1}$)。", "method": "单调有界定理(收敛性与余项界证明)", "difficulty": "进阶", "variant_kind": "证明型:莱布尼茨判别法的严格证明与余项估计推导", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["证明莱布尼茨判别法:若 $a_n$ 单调递减趋于 $0$,则交错级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n+1}a_n$ 收敛,且其和 $S$ 满足 $|S-S_N|\\le a_{N+1}$。", "证明见解法(偶子列单调有界、奇子列同极限;余项 $|S-S_N|\\le a_{N+1}$)。"], "steps": ["第一步:设$a_n\\ge0$、$a_{n+1}\\le a_n$且$a_n\\to0$，$S_N=\\sum_{n=1}^N(-1)^{n-1}a_n$。", "第二步:偶部分和递增，奇部分和递减，且$S_{2m}\\le S_{2l+1}$对一切$m,l$成立；两序列有界并有极限，差$S_{2N+1}-S_{2N}=a_{2N+1}\\to0$，故极限相同，记为$S$。", "第三步:由夹逼，对任意$N$有$0\\le(-1)^N(S-S_N)\\le a_{N+1}$，所以$|S-S_N|\\le a_{N+1}$。", "第四步:该证明只涉及有限部分和及其极限。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c10-05", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "b8291ccf6acb6544efd7f06a5eae6a554e4ef0960558afe6f49f9f4d952c7d66", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c10-05", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-015"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "补全奇偶部分和夹逼及带符号余项证明。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c10-05"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c12-01", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "函数项级数", "concept": "函数项级数一致收敛", "concept_id": "C12", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-017"], "problem": "证明函数项级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin nx}{n^2}$ 在 $\\mathbb R$ 上一致收敛。", "solution": "用魏尔斯特拉斯 $M$ 判别法:对一切 $x\\in\\mathbb R$,$\\left|\\frac{\\sin nx}{n^2}\\right|\\le\\frac{1}{n^2}=M_n$,而 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}M_n=\\sum\\frac{1}{n^2}$ 收敛。故级数在 $\\mathbb R$ 上一致收敛(且绝对一致收敛)。", "answer": "在 $\\mathbb R$ 上一致收敛($M$ 判别法,$M_n=\\frac{1}{n^2}$)。", "method": "魏尔斯特拉斯 M 判别法", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "方法变化:三角函数的 M 判别法(与幂级数父题不同)", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["证明函数项级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin nx}{n^2}$ 在 $\\mathbb R$ 上一致收敛。", "在 $\\mathbb R$ 上一致收敛($M$ 判别法,$M_n=\\frac{1}{n^2}$)。"], "steps": ["第一步:用魏尔斯特拉斯 $M$ 判别法:对一切 $x\\in\\mathbb R$,$\\left|\\frac{\\sin nx}{n^2}\\right|\\le\\frac{1}{n^2}=M_n$,而 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}M_n=\\sum\\frac{1}{n^2}$ 收敛。", "第二步:故级数在 $\\mathbb R$ 上一致收敛(且绝对一致收敛)。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c12-01", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "b317f15885ba72c3ef93b4ea9043aec8296fc856dcb5053e383f1789f47c18b4", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c12-01", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-017"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "sin项的统一上界1/n²可和，M判别适用全实轴；不求冻结Basel常数。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c12-01"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c12-02", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "函数项级数", "concept": "函数项级数一致收敛", "concept_id": "C12", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-017"], "problem": "证明 $\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}x^n$ 在 $[-\\frac12,\\frac12]$ 上一致收敛，并说明在 $(-1,1)$ 上不一致收敛。", "solution": "在$[-1/2,1/2]$上，$|x^n|\\le2^{-n}$，由M判别法一致收敛。在$(-1,1)$上点态和为$1/(1-x)$；从$n=0$到$N$的部分和尾项为$x^{N+1}/(1-x)$。对每个固定$N$，令$x\\to1^{-}$，尾项趋于$+\\infty$，其上确界为$+\\infty$，故不一致收敛。", "answer": "在 $[-\\frac12,\\frac12]$ 上一致收敛($M$ 判别法);在 $(-1,1)$ 上不一致收敛($\\sup|S_N-S|$ 不趋于 $0$)。", "method": "M 判别法+上确界判别(一致与不一致对照)", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "一致与逐点区别:同一级数在缩小区间与开区间上的收敛性对照", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["证明 $\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}x^n$ 在 $[-\\frac12,\\frac12]$ 上一致收敛，并说明在 $(-1,1)$ 上不一致收敛。", "在 $[-\\frac12,\\frac12]$ 上一致收敛($M$ 判别法);在 $(-1,1)$ 上不一致收敛($\\sup|S_N-S|$ 不趋于 $0$)。"], "steps": ["第一步:在$[-1/2,1/2]$上，$|x^n|\\le2^{-n}$，由M判别法一致收敛。", "第二步:在$(-1,1)$上点态和为$1/(1-x)$；从$n=0$到$N$的部分和尾项为$x^{N+1}/(1-x)$。", "第三步:对每个固定$N$，令$x\\to1^{-}$，尾项趋于$+\\infty$，其上确界为$+\\infty$，故不一致收敛。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c12-02", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "c06897f80a79850c46dd4610eca0991951886ca8afca507407618f116f177d27", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c12-02", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-017"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "用每个固定部分和的尾项上确界证明非一致收敛，去掉不必要渐近估算。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c12-02"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c12-03", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "函数项级数", "concept": "函数项级数一致收敛", "concept_id": "C12", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-017"], "problem": "证明$\\sum_{n\\ge1}\\sin(nx)/n$在$[\\delta,2\\pi-\\delta]$（$0<\\delta<\\pi$）上一致收敛，而在$(0,2\\pi)$上不一致收敛。不得用其和函数的图像代替证明。", "solution": "几何求和给任意正弦块$|\\sum_{n=p}^q\\sin(nx)|\\le1/|\\sin(x/2)|\\le1/\\sin(\\delta/2)$。对权$1/n$作分部求和，得到$|\\sum_{n=p}^q\\sin(nx)/n|\\le1/[p\\sin(\\delta/2)]$；此界与$x,q$无关，满足一致柯西准则。反之，取$x_N=\\pi/(4N)$，对$N+1\\le n\\le2N$，$\\pi/4<nx_N\\le\\pi/2$，故$\\sin(nx_N)\\ge\\sqrt2/2$且$1/n\\ge1/(2N)$，于是该块和不小于$\\sqrt2/4$。块和不能一致趋于零，因此在整个开区间不一致收敛。", "answer": "远离周期端点的闭区间上一致收敛；在$(0,2\\pi)$上不一致收敛。", "method": "一致Dirichlet与移动点反例", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "结构改写：一致Dirichlet与移动点反例", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["证明$\\sum_{n\\ge1}\\sin(nx)/n$在$[\\delta,2\\pi-\\delta]$（$0<\\delta<\\pi$）上一致收敛，而在$(0,2\\pi)$上不一致收敛。不得用其和函数的图像代替证明。", "远离周期端点的闭区间上一致收敛；在$(0,2\\pi)$上不一致收敛。"], "steps": ["第一步:几何求和给任意正弦块$|\\sum_{n=p}^q\\sin(nx)|\\le1/|\\sin(x/2)|\\le1/\\sin(\\delta/2)$。", "第二步:对权$1/n$作分部求和，得到$|\\sum_{n=p}^q\\sin(nx)/n|\\le1/[p\\sin(\\delta/2)]$；此界与$x,q$无关，满足一致柯西准则。", "第三步:反之，取$x_N=\\pi/(4N)$，对$N+1\\le n\\le2N$，$\\pi/4<nx_N\\le\\pi/2$，故$\\sin(nx_N)\\ge\\sqrt2/2$且$1/n\\ge1/(2N)$，于是该块和不小于$\\sqrt2/4$。", "第四步:块和不能一致趋于零，因此在整个开区间不一致收敛。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c12-03", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "ca758f532c54dccbceca09d3cad49200746c9283be371730cfd2467747ae48f7", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c12-03", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-017"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "替换对数生成函数变体，改为一致Dirichlet界与移动点柯西反例。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c12-03"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c12-04", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "函数项级数", "concept": "函数项级数一致收敛", "concept_id": "C12", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-017"], "problem": "固定$0<r<1$。证明$F_r(x)=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}r^n\\cos(nx)$在实轴上一致绝对收敛，求其和函数，并严格求$\\int_0^\\pi F_r(x)\\,dx$。", "solution": "$|r^n\\cos(nx)|\\le r^n$，几何级数可和，故在实轴上一致绝对收敛。取$\\sum r^ne^{inx}=1/(1-re^{ix})$的实部，得$F_r(x)=(1-r\\cos x)/(1-2r\\cos x+r^2)$；分母为$|1-re^{ix}|^2\\ge(1-r)^2>0$。一致收敛允许在$[0,\\pi]$逐项积分，常数项贡献$\\pi$，每个$n\\ge1$的积分$r^n[\\sin(nx)/n]_0^\\pi=0$，故积分为$\\pi$。", "answer": "$F_r(x)=\\frac{1-r\\cos x}{1-2r\\cos x+r^2}$，一致绝对收敛，积分$\\pi$。", "method": "复几何级数实部与一致积分", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "结构改写：复几何级数实部与一致积分", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["固定$0<r<1$。证明$F_r(x)=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}r^n\\cos(nx)$在实轴上一致绝对收敛，求其和函数，并严格求$\\int_0^\\pi F_r(x)\\,dx$。", "$F_r(x)=\\frac{1-r\\cos x}{1-2r\\cos x+r^2}$，一致绝对收敛，积分$\\pi$。"], "steps": ["第一步:$|r^n\\cos(nx)|\\le r^n$，几何级数可和，故在实轴上一致绝对收敛。", "第二步:取$\\sum r^ne^{inx}=1/(1-re^{ix})$的实部，得$F_r(x)=(1-r\\cos x)/(1-2r\\cos x+r^2)$；分母为$|1-re^{ix}|^2\\ge(1-r)^2>0$。", "第三步:一致收敛允许在$[0,\\pi]$逐项积分，常数项贡献$\\pi$，每个$n\\ge1$的积分$r^n[\\sin(nx)/n]_0^\\pi=0$，故积分为$\\pi$。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c12-04", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "259f92517ceb8fd810be209e30103fd6ff2d24bb2d2943e1f59524cbd3664dce", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c12-04", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-017"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "替换留出集的完整对数求和任务，改为周期核闭式与交换积分。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c12-04"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c12-05", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "函数项级数", "concept": "函数项级数一致收敛", "concept_id": "C12", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-017"], "problem": "证明函数列 $f_n(x)=n^2x(1-x^2)^n$($0\\le x\\le1$)逐点收敛于 $0$，但 $\\int_0^1f_n(x)\\,dx$ 不趋于 $0$；由此说明逐点收敛不足以保证极限与积分交换，并指出一致收敛为何是充分条件。", "solution": "$f_n(x)=n^2x(1-x^2)^n$在$[0,1]$逐点趋于零：端点直接为零，对$0<x<1$令$q=1-x^2<1$，$n^2q^n$的相邻比趋于$q<1$，故趋零。换元$u=1-x^2$给$\\int_0^1f_n(x)dx=n^2/[2(n+1)]\\ge n/4\\to\\infty$。由于$f_n\\ge0$且区间长度为$1$，$\\sup f_n\\ge\\int f_n\\ge n/4$，所以不可能一致趋零，也不能交换极限与积分。", "answer": "逐点极限$0$，非一致收敛；$\\int_0^1f_n=n^2/[2(n+1)]\\to+\\infty$，不能交换极限与积分。", "method": "反例构造(逐点收敛+积分不可交换)", "difficulty": "进阶", "variant_kind": "反例型:逐点收敛不足以保证积分交换的经典反例与充分条件说明", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["证明函数列 $f_n(x)=n^2x(1-x^2)^n$($0\\le x\\le1$)逐点收敛于 $0$，但 $\\int_0^1f_n(x)\\,dx$ 不趋于 $0$；由此说明逐点收敛不足以保证极限与积分交换，并指出一致收敛为何是充分条件。", "逐点极限$0$，非一致收敛；$\\int_0^1f_n=n^2/[2(n+1)]\\to+\\infty$，不能交换极限与积分。"], "steps": ["第一步:$f_n(x)=n^2x(1-x^2)^n$在$[0,1]$逐点趋于零：端点直接为零，对$0<x<1$令$q=1-x^2<1$，$n^2q^n$的相邻比趋于$q<1$，故趋零。", "第二步:换元$u=1-x^2$给$\\int_0^1f_n(x)dx=n^2/[2(n+1)]\\ge n/4\\to\\infty$。", "第三步:由于$f_n\\ge0$且区间长度为$1$，$\\sup f_n\\ge\\int f_n\\ge n/4$，所以不可能一致趋零，也不能交换极限与积分。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c12-05", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "2fdde915f73d27ba37349e7ab319e1701730366665184b52beeb648f46043c38", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c12-05", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-017"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "删去极大值渐近估算，用精确积分下界证明非一致收敛。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c12-05"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c14-01", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "傅立叶级数", "concept": "傅立叶展开", "concept_id": "C14", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-020"], "problem": "求$2\\pi$周期函数$f(x)=|\\sin x|$的实Fourier展开，证明展开在实轴上一致绝对收敛并确实等于$f$。", "solution": "$f$为偶函数，故$b_n=0$。$a_0=(2/\\pi)\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx=4/\\pi$。用积化和差积分可得$a_n=0$（$n$奇），$a_{2k}=-4/[\\pi(4k^2-1)]$（$k\\ge1$）；在$n=1$时直接积分也为零，不能在含零分母的通式中代入。故展开为$2/\\pi-(4/\\pi)\\sum_{k\\ge1}\\cos(2kx)/(4k^2-1)$。因$4k^2-1\\ge3k^2$，系数绝对可和，由M判别法一致绝对收敛。$f$连续且分段光滑，Dirichlet定理给每点Fourier和等于$f$；端点及尖点的左右值相同，所以也无跳跃取值问题。", "answer": "$|\\sin x|=\\frac2\\pi-\\frac4\\pi\\sum_{k\\ge1}\\frac{\\cos(2kx)}{4k^2-1}$，全实轴一致绝对收敛。", "method": "积化和差与绝对一致收敛", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "结构改写：积化和差与绝对一致收敛", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["求$2\\pi$周期函数$f(x)=|\\sin x|$的实Fourier展开，证明展开在实轴上一致绝对收敛并确实等于$f$。", "$|\\sin x|=\\frac2\\pi-\\frac4\\pi\\sum_{k\\ge1}\\frac{\\cos(2kx)}{4k^2-1}$，全实轴一致绝对收敛。"], "steps": ["第一步:$f$为偶函数，故$b_n=0$。", "第二步:$a_0=(2/\\pi)\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx=4/\\pi$。", "第三步:用积化和差积分可得$a_n=0$（$n$奇），$a_{2k}=-4/[\\pi(4k^2-1)]$（$k\\ge1$）；在$n=1$时直接积分也为零，不能在含零分母的通式中代入。", "第四步:故展开为$2/\\pi-(4/\\pi)\\sum_{k\\ge1}\\cos(2kx)/(4k^2-1)$。", "第五步:因$4k^2-1\\ge3k^2$，系数绝对可和，由M判别法一致绝对收敛。", "第六步:$f$连续且分段光滑，Dirichlet定理给每点Fourier和等于$f$；端点及尖点的左右值相同，所以也无跳跃取值问题。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c14-01", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "5d415d2e745ca6a8658490d1b648cba8534846059ca77a6d82d7b56d8292f30a", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c14-01", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-020"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "移除留出集Basel求和子任务，改为非多项式周期函数与一致性证明。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c14-01"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c14-02", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "傅立叶级数", "concept": "傅立叶展开", "concept_id": "C14", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-020"], "problem": "求$f(x)=x(\\pi-x)$在$[0,\\pi]$的半区间正弦展开，并说明周期奇延拓的端点值和收敛方式。", "solution": "$b_n=(2/\\pi)\\int_0^\\pi x(\\pi-x)\\sin(nx)dx$。两次分部积分，端点$f(0)=f(\\pi)=0$且$f^{\\prime\\prime}=-2$，得积分$2[1-(-1)^n]/n^3$，所以$b_n=4[1-(-1)^n]/(\\pi n^3)$。故$f(x)=(8/\\pi)\\sum_{k\\ge0}\\sin((2k+1)x)/(2k+1)^3$。奇延拓在$0,\\pm\\pi$左右极限都为零，连续、分段光滑；Dirichlet定理在每点取实际值。系数绝对可和，故周期展开全实轴一致绝对收敛。", "answer": "$x(\\pi-x)=\\frac8\\pi\\sum_{k\\ge0}\\frac{\\sin((2k+1)x)}{(2k+1)^3}$；端点为零，一致绝对收敛。", "method": "零端点半区间展开", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "结构改写：零端点半区间展开", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["求$f(x)=x(\\pi-x)$在$[0,\\pi]$的半区间正弦展开，并说明周期奇延拓的端点值和收敛方式。", "$x(\\pi-x)=\\frac8\\pi\\sum_{k\\ge0}\\frac{\\sin((2k+1)x)}{(2k+1)^3}$；端点为零，一致绝对收敛。"], "steps": ["第一步:$b_n=(2/\\pi)\\int_0^\\pi x(\\pi-x)\\sin(nx)dx$。", "第二步:两次分部积分，端点$f(0)=f(\\pi)=0$且$f^{\\prime\\prime}=-2$，得积分$2[1-(-1)^n]/n^3$，所以$b_n=4[1-(-1)^n]/(\\pi n^3)$。", "第三步:故$f(x)=(8/\\pi)\\sum_{k\\ge0}\\sin((2k+1)x)/(2k+1)^3$。", "第四步:奇延拓在$0,\\pm\\pi$左右极限都为零，连续、分段光滑；Dirichlet定理在每点取实际值。", "第五步:系数绝对可和，故周期展开全实轴一致绝对收敛。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c14-02", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "3eb0456375168c300a88627ca7281b99df7959c5a1e1d1989b5d6ead452022ed", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c14-02", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-020"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "替换与留出集相同的线性锯齿Fourier系列，改为零端点二次函数及立方衰减。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c14-02"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c14-03", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "傅立叶级数", "concept": "傅立叶展开", "concept_id": "C14", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-020"], "problem": "将$2\\pi$周期方波$f(x)=0$（$-\\pi<x<0$）、$f(x)=1$（$0<x<\\pi$）展开为Fourier级数；跳点$x\\in\\pi\\mathbb Z$处定义$f(x)=0$。说明非跳点及跳点的级数取值。", "solution": "$a_0=\\frac1\\pi\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}f(x)\\,dx=\\frac1\\pi\\int_0^{\\pi}1\\,dx=1$。$a_n=\\frac1\\pi\\int_0^{\\pi}\\cos nx\\,dx=\\frac{\\sin n\\pi}{n\\pi}=0$($n\\ge1$)。$b_n=\\frac1\\pi\\int_0^{\\pi}\\sin nx\\,dx=\\frac{1-\\cos n\\pi}{n\\pi}=\\frac{1-(-1)^n}{n\\pi}$,即奇数项 $b_{2k-1}=\\frac{2}{(2k-1)\\pi}$,偶数项为 $0$。故在非跳点 $f(x)=\\frac12+\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin(2k-1)x}{2k-1}$。在间断点 $x=0,\\pm\\pi$ 处,由狄利克雷定理,级数和为左右极限的平均值 $\\frac{0+1}{2}=\\frac12$。", "answer": "非跳点上$f(x)=\\frac12+\\frac2\\pi\\sum_{k\\ge0}\\frac{\\sin((2k+1)x)}{2k+1}$；在$x\\in\\pi\\mathbb Z$，级数和为$1/2$，与任意指定单点值无关。", "method": "分段函数展开+间断点取值", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "结构改写：分段函数展开+间断点取值", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["将$2\\pi$周期方波$f(x)=0$（$-\\pi<x<0$）、$f(x)=1$（$0<x<\\pi$）展开为Fourier级数；跳点$x\\in\\pi\\mathbb Z$处定义$f(x)=0$。说明非跳点及跳点的级数取值。", "非跳点上$f(x)=\\frac12+\\frac2\\pi\\sum_{k\\ge0}\\frac{\\sin((2k+1)x)}{2k+1}$；在$x\\in\\pi\\mathbb Z$，级数和为$1/2$，与任意指定单点值无关。"], "steps": ["第一步:$a_0=\\frac1\\pi\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}f(x)\\,dx=\\frac1\\pi\\int_0^{\\pi}1\\,dx=1$。", "第二步:$a_n=\\frac1\\pi\\int_0^{\\pi}\\cos nx\\,dx=\\frac{\\sin n\\pi}{n\\pi}=0$($n\\ge1$)。", "第三步:$b_n=\\frac1\\pi\\int_0^{\\pi}\\sin nx\\,dx=\\frac{1-\\cos n\\pi}{n\\pi}=\\frac{1-(-1)^n}{n\\pi}$,即奇数项 $b_{2k-1}=\\frac{2}{(2k-1)\\pi}$,偶数项为 $0$。", "第四步:故在非跳点 $f(x)=\\frac12+\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin(2k-1)x}{2k-1}$。", "第五步:在间断点 $x=0,\\pm\\pi$ 处,由狄利克雷定理,级数和为左右极限的平均值 $\\frac{0+1}{2}=\\frac12$。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c14-03", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "4323222394cd5f27c76eafd85c991d6edc6f57397fa67535d68ad234abbfcf00", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c14-03", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-020"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "区分实际定义的跳点值与Fourier左右平均值。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c14-03"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c14-04", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "傅立叶级数", "concept": "傅立叶展开", "concept_id": "C14", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-020"], "problem": "设$f(x)=3+2\\cos x-\\sin(2x)$，$g(x)=f(x-\\pi/3)$。求$g$的实Fourier系数，推导一般平移的系数变换，并证明每一频率的$a_n^2+b_n^2$不变。", "solution": "若平移量为$\\alpha$，展开加法公式得$a_n^{\\prime}=a_n\\cos(n\\alpha)-b_n\\sin(n\\alpha)$、$b_n^{\\prime}=a_n\\sin(n\\alpha)+b_n\\cos(n\\alpha)$，常数项不变。这是二维正交变换，平方相加消去交叉项，得$(a_n^{\\prime})^2+(b_n^{\\prime})^2=a_n^2+b_n^2$。本题$a_0=6,a_1=2,b_2=-1$，其余为零，代入$\\alpha=\\pi/3$得到$g(x)=3+\\cos x+\\sqrt3\\sin x+(\\sqrt3/2)\\cos(2x)+(1/2)\\sin(2x)$，有限展开无需收敛交换。", "answer": "$g=3+\\cos x+\\sqrt3\\sin x+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\cos2x+\\frac12\\sin2x$；各频率系数平方和不变。", "method": "Fourier平移作用与系数不变量", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "结构改写：Fourier平移作用与系数不变量", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["设$f(x)=3+2\\cos x-\\sin(2x)$，$g(x)=f(x-\\pi/3)$。求$g$的实Fourier系数，推导一般平移的系数变换，并证明每一频率的$a_n^2+b_n^2$不变。", "$g=3+\\cos x+\\sqrt3\\sin x+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\cos2x+\\frac12\\sin2x$；各频率系数平方和不变。"], "steps": ["第一步:若平移量为$\\alpha$，展开加法公式得$a_n^{\\prime}=a_n\\cos(n\\alpha)-b_n\\sin(n\\alpha)$、$b_n^{\\prime}=a_n\\sin(n\\alpha)+b_n\\cos(n\\alpha)$，常数项不变。", "第二步:这是二维正交变换，平方相加消去交叉项，得$(a_n^{\\prime})^2+(b_n^{\\prime})^2=a_n^2+b_n^2$。", "第三步:本题$a_0=6,a_1=2,b_2=-1$，其余为零，代入$\\alpha=\\pi/3$得到$g(x)=3+\\cos x+\\sqrt3\\sin x+(\\sqrt3/2)\\cos(2x)+(1/2)\\sin(2x)$，有限展开无需收敛交换。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c14-04", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "3e01d7b0e655444dd558204de190e6db71320c81d676bd987bfce281bf8bf3e6", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c14-04", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-020"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "替换相位改变的锯齿数值变体，改为系数变换及逐频率不变量。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c14-04"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c14-05", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "傅立叶级数", "concept": "傅立叶展开", "concept_id": "C14", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-020"], "problem": "令$f(x)=\\cos x$，$g(x)=\\cos x$（$x\\notin2\\pi\\mathbb Z$），而$g(x)=5$（$x\\in2\\pi\\mathbb Z$）。比较两者的Fourier系数与在$x=0$处的级数和。为什么系数相同不保证处处相同？", "solution": "在一个周期内，两函数只在有限点不同，这些点对积分无贡献，所以Fourier系数完全相同：$a_1=1$，其他系数为零，两者级数均为$\\cos x$。在$0$处级数和为$1$，等于左右极限平均值，而$g(0)=5$。Fourier积分无法辨识零测集上的取值；在此例两函数几乎处处相等，却不处处相等。没有连续性等附加条件，不能从系数相同推出逐点相同。", "answer": "系数相同，级数均为$\\cos x$；在$0$处和$1\\ne g(0)=5$。", "method": "Fourier单点值不可辨识性", "difficulty": "进阶", "variant_kind": "结构改写：Fourier单点值不可辨识性", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["令$f(x)=\\cos x$，$g(x)=\\cos x$（$x\\notin2\\pi\\mathbb Z$），而$g(x)=5$（$x\\in2\\pi\\mathbb Z$）。比较两者的Fourier系数与在$x=0$处的级数和。为什么系数相同不保证处处相同？", "系数相同，级数均为$\\cos x$；在$0$处和$1\\ne g(0)=5$。"], "steps": ["第一步:在一个周期内，两函数只在有限点不同，这些点对积分无贡献，所以Fourier系数完全相同：$a_1=1$，其他系数为零，两者级数均为$\\cos x$。", "第二步:在$0$处级数和为$1$，等于左右极限平均值，而$g(0)=5$。", "第三步:Fourier积分无法辨识零测集上的取值；在此例两函数几乎处处相等，却不处处相等。", "第四步:没有连续性等附加条件，不能从系数相同推出逐点相同。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-09-draft-c14-05", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-09", "source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "d23ac33b44bf3633bd77d4737e885c8c00cd05a4379f1d9ed9ab52cf597f8324", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "1cc220e2699b799fb9bacc8525e1f9d82321dc39dacd33e5c1caa21c1a7d959b", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c14-05", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-020"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "去掉同一方波的振幅变体，改为零测集修改与点态唯一性的边界。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-09/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "d9c5c3b0f67edfbd3ff79145f929c454b16ce6a8ac7bf29bb07b46a7addb91a7", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-09-draft-c14-05"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
